    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just an ache though. it's permanent. the way people look at me now... they see the scandal, they see the failure. they don't see \"the person inside.\" there is no person left to protect. what is the point of even trying to take a step when the ground itself is gone? it feels like i'm just a ghost haunted by my own life.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
